[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Analog and behavioral code-model requirements

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SCH-CM-GAIN
TITLE: gain code model
STATEMENT: >>>
The analog catalog shall expose gain with analog ports and applicable gain, limits and state. Validate terminal direction, domain, width and nullability against the executable schema.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Catalog target. Compare transfer and dynamic response and reject malformed values.
<<<

